  "description": "What better way to learn to ride a bike than with the most loveable and inexhaustible blue heeler, Bluey? The 10-inch Bluey Balance Bike by Dynacraft features a bright blue, green, and orange color scheme and is decked out in custom Bluey graphics. From Bluey and little sister Bingo on the frame, handlebar pad, and fork to a lively jungle pattern with Bluey and Bingo covering the seat and wheel covers, this bike will thrill every fan! We can learn a lot from the fun and imaginative world of Bluey and her family as they learn and grow through play. Learning to ride has never been more fun or easy than on the Bluey 10-inch Balance Bike by Dynacraft.",
